{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>One More Experiment\u00a0</i>is a first person puzzle-platformer based on elemental interactions.\u00a0 You control <i>The Absorber</i>, capable of absorbing fire and water from the environment.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Use this power to navigate around obstacles, activate switches and alter the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508790/extras/1_500.gif?t=1742987377\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508790/extras/DemoF.png?t=1742987377\" />\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508790/extras/logo_6_Small_2.png?t=1742987377\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four chapters with mind-bending puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with fire, water, vines, pipes, balloons, ice and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use switches to alter the environment around you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate around obstacles such as force fields, spikes and moving platforms\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an abandoned lab complex\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four unique ambient soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Xbox Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-Player mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508790/extras/2_500.gif?t=1742987377\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508790/extras/3_500.gif?t=1742987377\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508790/extras/AdditionalF.png?t=1742987377\" />\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508790/extras/ElementGun_Smaller.png?t=1742987377\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">(Full game / upcoming):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A total of eight chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New puzzle objects and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More varied environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additional soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voice acted\u00a0dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More developed story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam-integrations, (achievements etc.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sections with more freedom, and less linear gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fullversion release in September 2025!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508790/extras/Controls.png?t=1742987377\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MOVE: WASD / L Stick </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">JUMP: Space / A</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">INTERACT: E / X  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ABSORB: R Mouse / LB</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SHOOT: L Mouse / RB</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SPRINT: L Shift /\u00a0LT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RELOAD CHECKPOINT: Backspace / Back</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508790?t=1742987377","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508790?t=1742987377","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508790/8e1a8909c0df86140b9b43b118983229cebecc2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742987377","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508790/8e